            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "I still remember his habits. Always arriving at the office early and leaving late."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "He used to talk about becoming a Trainer, before everything became calendars and paydays."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "Looks like you’re living the version of life he used to talk about. That’s funny."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"I want a favor from you."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "Consider it my way of seeing what became of the dream your dad used to carry around."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"Can we have a Pokémon battle?"},
